### Kck.Sample.Orders — every endpoint, ready to send.
### Create a token first: dotnet user-jwts create --project samples/Kck.Sample.Orders
### and paste it below.
@host = https://localhost:7180
@token = paste-the-token-here
@customerId = 0199f0a0-0000-7000-8000-000000000001
@orderId = paste-an-order-id-here

### Health (no token)
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Product catalogue (cached for five minutes)
GET {{host}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Place an order: 201 and an OrderPlaced log after the commit
POST {{host}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "{{customerId}}", "lines": [ { "sku": "A-1", "quantity": 2 } ] }

### Not enough stock (B-2 has 5): 409, nothing saved, no event
POST {{host}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "{{customerId}}", "lines": [ { "sku": "A-1", "quantity": 1 }, { "sku": "B-2", "quantity": 6 } ] }

### One order
GET {{host}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Orders, newest first (index is 0-based)
GET {{host}}/orders?index=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search: only Status, CustomerId and CreatedDate may be used
POST {{host}}/orders/search?index=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "filter": { "field": "Status", "operator": "eq", "value": "Paid" }, "sort": [ { "field": "CreatedDate", "dir": "desc" } ] }

### Pay, then ship
POST {{host}}/orders/{{orderId}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{host}}/orders/{{orderId}}/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel (soft delete; 409 once shipped)
DELETE {{host}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A cancelled order is still there with includeDeleted
GET {{host}}/orders/{{orderId}}?includeDeleted=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a customer
POST {{host}}/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ada" }

### Delete a customer (409 while they have orders)
DELETE {{host}}/customers/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
